    {
      "height": 373,
      "id": "3fca4daaaf6d572a",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-card-gradient-0deg, cc-border-none, cc-border-squared\n---\n\n##### AC3200 tri-band wireless router\nThe heart of my system is my AC3200 tri-band wireless router which can broadcast three strong wifi signals to handle all our devices. ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 180,
      "x": 900,
      "y": -233
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 247,
      "id": "a698a7ce3be00ec3",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-card-gradient-0deg, cc-border-none, cc-border-squared\n---\n\n##### Fast and Secure\n\nHaving a fast and secure home network is crucial for my family since we rely on the internet for work, school, and entertainment. My home network starts with a cable modem that connects to my internet service provider.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 302,
      "x": -279,
      "y": -260
    },
    {
      "file": "Samples/media/home-netowrk/fhn-cc-image.svg",
      "height": 93,
      "id": "6463da20315eb17e",
